# Keep EVERY canonical skill asset LF-only, not just SKILL.md. The guard that compares a
# generated projection against canonical material is a byte-for-byte snapshot equality, and
# core.autocrlf=true rewrites any unpinned asset to CRLF on Windows checkouts. Measured
# 2026-10-26: skill-sources/typesafe-ai/LICENSE was blob 1068B/LF vs checkout 1089B/CRLF, and
# 68 of 128 skill-source assets (both repos) arrived CRLF - a 21-byte line-ending-only diff
# that permanently blocked projection adoption and made the drift gate report an ownership
# problem. text=auto keeps git's own binary detection for non-text assets.
skill-sources/** text=auto eol=lf

# Vendored upstream material is verified by a recorded sha256, which is a claim about
# bytes. Without a pin, core.autocrlf=true hashes CRLF on a Windows checkout while the
# repository stores LF, so every vendored file reports DAMAGED/modified on Linux and the
# gate is green only for the person who recorded the digests. Measured 2026-11-03: all 21
# entries mismatched on the LF bytes.
vendor/stageshow/** text=auto eol=lf

# Drift guards compare generated specs against canonical sources byte-for-byte;
# pin the working tree to LF on every platform so Windows checkouts do not
# flunk guards that Linux CI passes.
agent-sources/**/*.md text eol=lf
agent-sources/**/*.json text eol=lf
scripts/lib/tooling/specs/*.json text eol=lf
docs-site/llms.txt text eol=lf
# Skill 训练认证产物是跟 Git blob 做内容哈希比对的字节约定（baseline-skill.md 等），
# 所以它和上面几条一样必须钉 LF：否则 Windows 检出把证据刷成 CRLF，
# 已接受的认证会在下一次干净检出时被自己的基线守卫推翻。
docs/evidence/skill-training/** text eol=lf
# 客户端能力评分报告同理：`scripts/tests/client-capability-scorecard.test.mjs`
# 拿已提交报告与重新渲染结果做逐字节比较，而生成器只写 LF。`core.autocrlf=true`
# 的 Windows 检出会把工作树刷成 CRLF，于是同一份内容在 Linux 绿、在 Windows 红。
# 钉住 LF 而不是在测试里归一化换行：归一化会把“提交内容真的变了”和
# “只是被检出转了行尾”两类信号合并掉，前者该响、后者不该响。
docs/reports/*client-capability-scorecard.md text eol=lf
/AGENTS.md text eol=lf
/CLAUDE.md text eol=lf
/GEMINI.md text eol=lf
